2026-07-27T07:41:59.0598970Z i /tmp/RtmpkwG2hU/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0599293Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0599648Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0600188Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0600688Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0601402Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:41:59.0601963Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
